N1  - VERIFY-CITE: page range 263-278 per the ScienceDirect listing checked 2026-08-27; some secondary sources quote 263-280. General doubling step: Aut(A_{n+1}) = Aut(A_n) x G with G in {Z/2, S_3}; proves Brown's conjecture on the higher Cayley-Dickson automorphism groups (per Chan and Dokovic). Over R with the standard parameters the branch is S_3 at every rung >= 4 (Brown proved equality for n = 4, 5, 6; notebook T checks rungs 4-6 directly). Used by: sec:wf-chain-type (Wigner chain coda), rem:no-fifth-force (sedenion section, 2026-08-27 revision).
