N1  - VERIFY-CITE: volume 76 and JSTOR doi from memory; confirm volume/issue/doi before commit. Derivation algebra of the Cayley-Dickson algebras: Der(A_n) = g_2 for n >= 3 (no new derivations beyond the octonions; the identity component of Aut never grows). Notebook T confirms dim Der = 14 at n = 3, 4, 5 numerically. Used by: sec:wf-chain-type, rem:no-fifth-force (2026-08-27 revision).
